-- Core Team members (35, in website order) so every environment shows the team without a manual import.
-- Data only, public fields only: name, village, designation (English and Hindi), order and the one photo path.
-- No mobile, email or links to logins / family members / students (those stay empty; an admin can link them).
-- INSERT IGNORE: an environment that already has a row with the same id or active key keeps it unchanged,
-- and nothing is deleted or overwritten. The section itself comes from 20261126000000_event_member_applications.
-- The photo file must exist in that server's UPLOADS_DIR; otherwise the card shows initials until an admin uploads one.
